        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R5BMS, 4\" x 4\" x 5/8\" Radius Benchmark Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with doors manufactured by <b>Benchmark</b>. Utilizes a special zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with <b>Benchmark Doors</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R5BMS.gif?v=1704354744\" width=\"400\" height=\"351\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Benchmark Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-x-5-8-radius-benchmark-door-spring-hinge-deltana-dsh4r5bm\"><b>4 Inch Benchmark Door Spring Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws. Fitted with a high grade removable steel hinge pin and built-in security hinge tab.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4\" Benchmark Door Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" </li>\r\n<li><b>Benchmark Door Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</b></li>\r\n<li>Built in Security Tab</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin:  Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44RBMS-specifications.pdf?v=1704262280\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R5BMS Benchmark Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Door Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius Benchmark Door Hinges",
                "description": "Deltana S44R5BMS Benchmark hinge. Special zig-zag hole pattern for use with Benchmark doors - 4 x 4 x 5/8 radius corners and security tab. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching steel flathead, Phillips screws. Use with doors manufactured by Benchmark.",
